{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:39:44.240Z","tool_name":"update_topic","tool_id":"update_topic__call_173247","parameters":{"summary":"Pre-validation testing over 2026-07-16 to 2026-09-13 (split into H1 and H2) identified four consistent improvements: (1) pre-path column standardization (pre_col_std) before applying RMS-normalized stratified path multipliers, (2) hierarchical orthogonal secant projection (30m and 3h block calibration on CRYPTO_24H and 1h HYPE trend calibration), (3) 4-estimator hybrid EWMA (L2 + L1 + scale-anchored 5m MAD + 1m True-Range OHLC) in CRYPTO_24H and CRYPTO_1H plus a 6% long-term sigma anchor in CRYPTO_1H, and (4) extending off-hours negative EWMA deviation damping to SPCX and SP500. I am now updating agent/modeling.py and running the full 1,000-simulation backtests on Window A and Window B.","title":"Implementing and Evaluating Iteration 10","strategic_intent":"Implement Iteration 10 in agent/modeling.py and evaluate at 1,000 simulations across Window A and Window B for all three competitions."}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:40:52.603Z","tool_name":"replace","tool_id":"replace__call_174938","parameters":{"instruction":"Update agent/modeling.py to Iteration 10: upgrade _apply_secant_shocks to support hierarchical orthogonal sub-block/block/total secant projection, add scale-anchored 5m MAD and 1m True-Range OHLC blending to CRYPTO_24H and CRYPTO_1H with 6% LT anchor in CRYPTO_1H, extend off-hours negative EWMA damping to SPCX and SP500, and standardize base step shocks by column before applying RMS-normalized stratified path multipliers.","file_path":"/workspace/agent/modeling.py","new_string":"def _apply_secant_shocks(\n    shocks_inc: np.ndarray,\n    eta_tot: float,\n    eta_blk: float = 1.0,\n    n_blks: int = 8,\n    eta_sub: float = 1.0,\n    n_sub: int = 48,\n) -> np.ndarray:\n    out = shocks_inc\n    if abs(eta_sub - 1.0) > 1e-6 and out.shape[1] >= n_sub:\n        s_len = out.shape[1] // n_sub\n        out = out.copy()\n        for s in range(n_sub):\n            sl = slice(s * s_len, (s + 1) * s_len)\n            sub = out[:, sl]\n            s2 = np.var(sub, axis=0)\n            w = s2 / max(float(np.sum(s2)), 1e-12)\n            s_sum = np.sum(sub, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n            out[:, sl] = sub + (eta_sub - 1.0) * s_sum * w[None, :]\n    eff_blk = eta_blk / eta_sub if eta_sub != 0.0 else eta_blk\n    if abs(eff_blk - 1.0) > 1e-6 and out.shape[1] >= n_blks:\n        b_len = out.shape[1] // n_blks\n        if out is shocks_inc:\n            out = out.copy()\n        for b in range(n_blks):\n            sl = slice(b * b_len, (b + 1) * b_len)\n            sub = out[:, sl]\n            s2 = np.var(sub, axis=0)\n            w = s2 / max(float(np.sum(s2)), 1e-12)\n            b_sum = np.sum(sub, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n            out[:, sl] = sub + (eff_blk - 1.0) * b_sum * w[None, :]\n    eff_tot = eta_tot / eta_blk if eta_blk != 0.0 else eta_tot\n    if abs(eff_tot - 1.0) > 1e-6:\n        s2 = np.var(out, axis=0)\n        w = s2 / max(float(np.sum(s2)), 1e-12)\n        t_sum = np.sum(out, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n        out = out + (eff_tot - 1.0) * t_sum * w[None, :]\n    return out\n\n\ndef simulate(\n    asset: str,\n    start_time,\n    time_increment: int = 300,\n    time_length: int = 86_400,\n    num_simulations: int = 1000,\n    context_prices=None,\n):\n    rng = _make_rng(asset, start_time, time_length)\n    steps = time_length // time_increment + 1\n    n_inc = steps - 1\n    step_mins = max(time_increment // 60, 1)\n    is_1h = time_length <= 3600\n\n    if isinstance(context_prices, pd.DataFrame):\n        close_series = context_prices[\"close\"]\n        full_idx = context_prices.index\n    else:\n        close_series = context_prices\n        full_idx = close_series.index\n\n    vals = close_series.to_numpy(dtype=np.float64)\n    valid_pos = np.flatnonzero(np.isfinite(vals))\n    if valid_pos.size == 0:\n        last = 1.0\n    else:\n        last = float(vals[valid_pos[-1]])\n\n    s2_back = _S2_BACK_336.get(asset, _DEFAULT_S2_336)\n    if is_1h:\n        s2_f_raw = _S2_FWD_336.get(asset, s2_back)\n        s2_f_norm = s2_f_raw / np.mean(s2_f_raw)\n        s2_btc_raw = _S2_FWD_336.get(\"BTC\", s2_back)\n        s2_btc_norm = s2_btc_raw / np.mean(s2_btc_raw)\n        s2_fwd = 0.35 * s2_back + 0.45 * s2_f_norm + 0.20 * s2_btc_norm\n    else:\n        s2_fwd = _S2_FWD_336.get(asset, s2_back)\n        if asset in CRYPTO_ASSETS and float(np.mean(s2_fwd[240:])) > 0.70 * float(np.mean(s2_fwd[:240])):\n            s2_fwd = s2_fwd.copy()\n            s2_fwd[240:288] *= 0.94\n    lt_sigma = LONG_TERM_SIGMA_1M.get(asset, 5e-4)\n\n    start_us = _timestamp_to_utc_us(start_time)\n    fwd_min_offsets = np.arange(1, n_inc * step_mins + 1, dtype=np.int64)\n    fwd_us = start_us + fwd_min_offsets * 60_000_000\n    fwd_slots = _slots_from_utc_us(fwd_us)\n    fwd_s2_min = (\n        s2_fwd[fwd_slots]\n        * _subslot_modulation(fwd_us, asset, is_1h)\n        * _event_variance_multiplier(fwd_us, asset)\n    )\n    fwd_s2 = fwd_s2_min.reshape(n_inc, step_mins).sum(axis=1)\n    step_seas_sqrt = np.sqrt(np.maximum(fwd_s2, 1e-4))\n    s2_fwd_mean = float(np.mean(fwd_s2_min))\n\n    brk_mult = 1.0\n    if valid_pos.size > 10:\n        grid_us = _index_to_utc_us(full_idx)\n        grid_slots = _slots_from_utc_us(grid_us)\n        grid_s2 = (\n            s2_back[grid_slots]\n            * _subslot_modulation(grid_us, asset, is_1h)\n            * _event_variance_multiplier(grid_us, asset)\n        )\n        grid_s2_cumsum = np.concatenate(([0.0], np.cumsum(grid_s2)))\n\n        valid_vals = vals[valid_pos]\n        rets = np.diff(np.log(valid_vals))\n        finite = np.isfinite(rets)\n        if not np.all(finite):\n            rets = np.where(finite, rets, 0.0)\n\n        ds2 = grid_s2_cumsum[valid_pos[1:] + 1] - grid_s2_cumsum[valid_pos[:-1] + 1]\n        ds2 = np.maximum(ds2, 1e-4)\n\n        rate_ds = (rets ** 2) / ds2\n        pos_rates = rate_ds[rate_ds > 0]\n        if pos_rates.size > 10:\n            cap_ds = float(np.percentile(pos_rates, 98.5))\n            r2_win = np.minimum(rate_ds, cap_ds) * ds2\n        else:\n            r2_win = rets ** 2\n\n        r1_scaled = 1.2533141373155001 * np.abs(rets) * np.sqrt(ds2)\n\n        t_end_us = int(grid_us[-1])\n        valid_us = grid_us[valid_pos]\n        t_mid_us = 0.5 * (valid_us[1:] + valid_us[:-1])\n        age_bar_min = np.maximum((t_end_us - t_mid_us) / 60_000_000.0, 0.0)\n\n        g_slice = slice(int(valid_pos[0]), len(grid_us))\n        age_grid_min = np.maximum((t_end_us - grid_us[g_slice]) / 60_000_000.0, 0.0)\n        s2_grid_active = grid_s2[g_slice]\n\n        ewma_l2 = np.empty(len(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6), dtype=np.float64)\n        ewma_l1 = np.empty(len(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6), dtype=np.float64)\n        s2_bar_k = np.empty(len(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6), dtype=np.float64)\n        for i, lam in enumerate(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6):\n            w_bar = np.exp(-lam * age_bar_min)\n            w_grid = np.exp(-lam * age_grid_min)\n            den = max(float(np.dot(w_grid, s2_grid_active)), 1e-6)\n            s2_bar_k[i] = den / max(float(np.sum(w_grid)), 1e-6)\n            ewma_l2[i] = np.sqrt(max(float(np.dot(w_bar, r2_win)) / den, 1e-12))\n            ewma_l1[i] = max(float(np.dot(w_bar, r1_scaled)) / den, 1e-6)\n\n        log_l2 = np.log(np.maximum(ewma_l2, 1e-6))\n        log_l1 = np.log(np.maximum(ewma_l1, 1e-6))\n        log_mad5 = _compute_5m_mad_ewma(valid_pos, rets, grid_us, grid_s2)\n        if log_mad5 is None:\n            log_mad5 = log_l2\n        mad5_anc = log_mad5 - log_mad5[5] + log_l2[5]\n        log_hl = _compute_ohlc_log_ewma(context_prices, g_slice, age_grid_min, s2_grid_active, float(log_l2[5]))\n        if log_hl is None:\n            log_hl = log_l2\n\n        if is_1h:\n            log_ewma = 0.40 * log_l2 + 0.15 * (log_l1 + 0.12) + 0.20 * mad5_anc + 0.25 * log_hl\n            sigma_short = float(np.exp(np.dot(WEIGHTS_1H_START, log_ewma)))\n            sigma_long_ctx = float(np.exp(np.dot(WEIGHTS_1H_END, log_ewma)))\n            sigma_long = float(np.exp(0.94 * np.log(sigma_long_ctx) + 0.06 * np.log(lt_sigma)))\n        else:\n            if asset in CRYPTO_ASSETS:\n                log_ewma = 0.60 * log_l2 + 0.15 * (log_l1 + 0.20) + 0.15 * mad5_anc + 0.10 * log_hl\n            else:\n                if asset == \"XAU\":\n                    log_ewma = 0.82 * log_l2 + 0.18 * (log_mad5 + 0.05)\n                else:\n                    log_ewma = 0.55 * log_l2 + 0.15 * (log_l1 + 0.05) + 0.22 * (log_mad5 + 0.05) + 0.08 * log_hl\n                if asset in {\"XAU\", \"WTIOIL\", \"GOOGLX\", \"TSLAX\", \"SPCX\", \"SP500\"}:\n                    alpha_k = np.minimum(s2_bar_k / max(s2_fwd_mean, 0.1), 1.0)\n                    diff_k = log_ewma - log_ewma[5]\n                    log_ewma = np.where(diff_k < 0.0, log_ewma[5] + (0.5 + 0.5 * alpha_k) * diff_k, log_ewma)\n            w_long = WEIGHTS_24H_LONG\n            p_w = 0.10\n            sigma_short = float(np.exp(np.dot(WEIGHTS_24H_SHORT, log_ewma)))\n            sigma_long_ctx = float(np.exp(np.dot(w_long, log_ewma)))\n            sigma_long = float(\n                np.exp((1.0 - p_w) * np.log(sigma_long_ctx) + p_w * np.log(lt_sigma))\n            )\n            if asset in CRYPTO_ASSETS and len(vals) >= 1440:\n                idx_24h = int(np.searchsorted(valid_pos, max(0, len(vals) - 1440)))\n                rv_24h = float(np.sqrt(np.sum(rets[idx_24h:] ** 2)))\n                er_24h = abs(float(np.log(vals[valid_pos[-1]] / vals[valid_pos[idx_24h]]))) / max(rv_24h, 1e-6)\n                if er_24h < 0.35:\n                    brk_mult = 1.0 - 0.06 * (0.35 - er_24h)\n                elif er_24h > 0.55 and sigma_short > sigma_long:\n                    brk_mult = 1.0 + 0.05 * min(er_24h - 0.55, 0.45)\n    else:\n        sigma_short = lt_sigma\n        sigma_long = lt_sigma\n\n    c_scale, sig_path_vv, sig_step_vv = _distribution_params(asset, time_length)\n\n    mid_lead_mins = (np.arange(n_inc, dtype=np.float64) + 0.5) * step_mins\n    rev_tau = REVERSION_TAU_1H if is_1h else REVERSION_TAU_24H\n    decay = np.exp(-mid_lead_mins / rev_tau)\n    sigma_base_t = sigma_long * ((sigma_short / max(sigma_long, 1e-8)) ** decay)\n\n    per_step_sigma = (c_scale * brk_mult * sigma_base_t) * step_seas_sqrt\n\n    half = num_simulations // 2\n    if half > 0:\n        eps = rng.standard_normal((half, n_inc))\n        if sig_step_vv > 0.0:\n            eta = rng.standard_normal((half, n_inc))\n            eps = eps * np.exp(sig_step_vv * eta - 0.5 * sig_step_vv * sig_step_vv)\n        if not is_1h:\n            z_step = np.vstack([eps, -eps])\n            col_std = np.std(z_step, axis=0, keepdims=True)\n            eps = eps / np.where(col_std > 1e-8, col_std, 1.0)\n            if sig_path_vv > 0.0:\n                q_z = _stratified_normal_quantiles(half)\n                m_half = np.exp(sig_path_vv * q_z - 0.5 * sig_path_vv * sig_path_vv)[:, None]\n                m_rms = float(np.sqrt(np.mean(m_half ** 2)))\n                eps = eps * (m_half / m_rms)\n            if num_simulations % 2 == 1:\n                z_extra = rng.standard_normal((1, n_inc))\n                z = np.vstack([eps, -eps, z_extra])\n            else:\n                z = np.vstack([eps, -eps])\n        else:\n            if sig_path_vv > 0.0:\n                q_z = _stratified_normal_quantiles(half)\n                m_half = np.exp(sig_path_vv * q_z - 0.5 * sig_path_vv * sig_path_vv)[:, None]\n                eps = eps * m_half\n            if num_simulations % 2 == 1:\n                z_extra = rng.standard_normal((1, n_inc))\n                z = np.vstack([eps, -eps, z_extra])\n            else:\n                z = np.vstack([eps, -eps])\n            col_std = np.std(z, axis=0, keepdims=True)\n            z = z / np.where(col_std > 1e-8, col_std, 1.0)\n    else:\n        z = rng.standard_normal((num_simulations, n_inc))\n\n    shocks_inc = z * per_step_sigma[None, :]\n    if is_1h:\n        if asset == \"HYPE\":\n            shocks_inc = _apply_secant_shocks(shocks_inc, eta_tot=1.04, eta_blk=0.99, n_blks=4, eta_sub=1.02, n_sub=12)\n        elif asset != \"ETH\":\n            shocks_inc = _apply_secant_shocks(shocks_inc, eta_tot=0.95, eta_blk=0.95, n_blks=4)\n    elif asset in CRYPTO_ASSETS:\n        if asset != \"HYPE\":\n            shocks_inc = _apply_secant_shocks(shocks_inc, eta_tot=1.00, eta_blk=0.93, n_blks=8, eta_sub=0.96, n_sub=48)\n    else:\n        eta_equ = 1.05 if asset == \"SPCX\" else 1.09\n        shocks_inc = _apply_secant_shocks(shocks_inc, eta_tot=eta_equ, eta_blk=1.0, n_blks=8)\n\n    shocks = np.empty((num_simulations, steps), dtype=np.float64)\n    shocks[:, 0] = 0.0\n    shocks[:, 1:] = shocks_inc\n    paths = last * np.exp(np.cumsum(shocks, axis=1))\n    return (start_time, time_increment, *[p.tolist() for p in paths])","old_string":"def _apply_secant_shocks(\n    shocks_inc: np.ndarray,\n    eta_tot: float,\n    eta_blk: float = 1.0,\n    n_blks: int = 8,\n) -> np.ndarray:\n    out = shocks_inc\n    if eta_blk != 1.0 and out.shape[1] >= n_blks:\n        b_len = out.shape[1] // n_blks\n        out = out.copy()\n        for b in range(n_blks):\n            sl = slice(b * b_len, (b + 1) * b_len)\n            sub = out[:, sl]\n            s2 = np.var(sub, axis=0)\n            w = s2 / max(float(np.sum(s2)), 1e-12)\n            b_sum = np.sum(sub, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n            out[:, sl] = sub + (eta_blk - 1.0) * b_sum * w[None, :]\n    if eta_tot != 1.0:\n        s2 = np.var(out, axis=0)\n        w = s2 / max(float(np.sum(s2)), 1e-12)\n        t_sum = np.sum(out, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n        out = out + (eta_tot - 1.0) * t_sum * w[None, :]\n    return out\n\n\ndef simulate(\n    asset: str,\n    start_time,\n    time_increment: int = 300,\n    time_length: int = 86_400,\n    num_simulations: int = 1000,\n    context_prices=None,\n):\n    rng = _make_rng(asset, start_time, time_length)\n    steps = time_length // time_increment + 1\n    n_inc = steps - 1\n    step_mins = max(time_increment // 60, 1)\n    is_1h = time_length <= 3600\n\n    if isinstance(context_prices, pd.DataFrame):\n        close_series = context_prices[\"close\"]\n        full_idx = context_prices.index\n    else:\n        close_series = context_prices\n        full_idx = close_series.index\n\n    vals = close_series.to_numpy(dtype=np.float64)\n    valid_pos = np.flatnonzero(np.isfinite(vals))\n    if valid_pos.size == 0:\n        last = 1.0\n    else:\n        last = float(vals[valid_pos[-1]])\n\n    s2_back = _S2_BACK_336.get(asset, _DEFAULT_S2_336)\n    if is_1h:\n        s2_f_raw = _S2_FWD_336.get(asset, s2_back)\n        s2_f_norm = s2_f_raw / np.mean(s2_f_raw)\n        s2_btc_raw = _S2_FWD_336.get(\"BTC\", s2_back)\n        s2_btc_norm = s2_btc_raw / np.mean(s2_btc_raw)\n        s2_fwd = 0.35 * s2_back + 0.45 * s2_f_norm + 0.20 * s2_btc_norm\n    else:\n        s2_fwd = _S2_FWD_336.get(asset, s2_back)\n        if asset in CRYPTO_ASSETS and float(np.mean(s2_fwd[240:])) > 0.70 * float(np.mean(s2_fwd[:240])):\n            s2_fwd = s2_fwd.copy()\n            s2_fwd[240:288] *= 0.94\n    lt_sigma = LONG_TERM_SIGMA_1M.get(asset, 5e-4)\n\n    start_us = _timestamp_to_utc_us(start_time)\n    fwd_min_offsets = np.arange(1, n_inc * step_mins + 1, dtype=np.int64)\n    fwd_us = start_us + fwd_min_offsets * 60_000_000\n    fwd_slots = _slots_from_utc_us(fwd_us)\n    fwd_s2_min = (\n        s2_fwd[fwd_slots]\n        * _subslot_modulation(fwd_us, asset, is_1h)\n        * _event_variance_multiplier(fwd_us, asset)\n    )\n    fwd_s2 = fwd_s2_min.reshape(n_inc, step_mins).sum(axis=1)\n    step_seas_sqrt = np.sqrt(np.maximum(fwd_s2, 1e-4))\n    s2_fwd_mean = float(np.mean(fwd_s2_min))\n\n    brk_mult = 1.0\n    if valid_pos.size > 10:\n        grid_us = _index_to_utc_us(full_idx)\n        grid_slots = _slots_from_utc_us(grid_us)\n        grid_s2 = (\n            s2_back[grid_slots]\n            * _subslot_modulation(grid_us, asset, is_1h)\n            * _event_variance_multiplier(grid_us, asset)\n        )\n        grid_s2_cumsum = np.concatenate(([0.0], np.cumsum(grid_s2)))\n\n        valid_vals = vals[valid_pos]\n        rets = np.diff(np.log(valid_vals))\n        finite = np.isfinite(rets)\n        if not np.all(finite):\n            rets = np.where(finite, rets, 0.0)\n\n        ds2 = grid_s2_cumsum[valid_pos[1:] + 1] - grid_s2_cumsum[valid_pos[:-1] + 1]\n        ds2 = np.maximum(ds2, 1e-4)\n\n        rate_ds = (rets ** 2) / ds2\n        pos_rates = rate_ds[rate_ds > 0]\n        if pos_rates.size > 10:\n            cap_ds = float(np.percentile(pos_rates, 98.5))\n            r2_win = np.minimum(rate_ds, cap_ds) * ds2\n        else:\n            r2_win = rets ** 2\n\n        r1_scaled = 1.2533141373155001 * np.abs(rets) * np.sqrt(ds2)\n\n        t_end_us = int(grid_us[-1])\n        valid_us = grid_us[valid_pos]\n        t_mid_us = 0.5 * (valid_us[1:] + valid_us[:-1])\n        age_bar_min = np.maximum((t_end_us - t_mid_us) / 60_000_000.0, 0.0)\n\n        g_slice = slice(int(valid_pos[0]), len(grid_us))\n        age_grid_min = np.maximum((t_end_us - grid_us[g_slice]) / 60_000_000.0, 0.0)\n        s2_grid_active = grid_s2[g_slice]\n\n        ewma_l2 = np.empty(len(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6), dtype=np.float64)\n        ewma_l1 = np.empty(len(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6), dtype=np.float64)\n        s2_bar_k = np.empty(len(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6), dtype=np.float64)\n        for i, lam in enumerate(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6):\n            w_bar = np.exp(-lam * age_bar_min)\n            w_grid = np.exp(-lam * age_grid_min)\n            den = max(float(np.dot(w_grid, s2_grid_active)), 1e-6)\n            s2_bar_k[i] = den / max(float(np.sum(w_grid)), 1e-6)\n            ewma_l2[i] = np.sqrt(max(float(np.dot(w_bar, r2_win)) / den, 1e-12))\n            ewma_l1[i] = max(float(np.dot(w_bar, r1_scaled)) / den, 1e-6)\n\n        log_l2 = np.log(np.maximum(ewma_l2, 1e-6))\n        log_l1 = np.log(np.maximum(ewma_l1, 1e-6))\n        log_mad5 = _compute_5m_mad_ewma(valid_pos, rets, grid_us, grid_s2)\n        if log_mad5 is None:\n            log_mad5 = log_l2\n        log_hl = _compute_ohlc_log_ewma(context_prices, g_slice, age_grid_min, s2_grid_active, float(log_l2[5]))\n        if log_hl is None:\n            log_hl = log_l2\n\n        if is_1h:\n            log_ewma = 0.45 * log_l2 + 0.20 * log_l1 + 0.20 * log_mad5 + 0.15 * log_hl\n            sigma_short = float(np.exp(np.dot(WEIGHTS_1H_START, log_ewma)))\n            sigma_long = float(np.exp(np.dot(WEIGHTS_1H_END, log_ewma)))\n        else:\n            if asset in CRYPTO_ASSETS:\n                log_ewma = 0.80 * log_l2 + 0.20 * (log_l1 + 0.20)\n            else:\n                if asset == \"XAU\":\n                    log_ewma = 0.82 * log_l2 + 0.18 * (log_mad5 + 0.05)\n                else:\n                    log_ewma = 0.55 * log_l2 + 0.15 * (log_l1 + 0.05) + 0.22 * (log_mad5 + 0.05) + 0.08 * log_hl\n                if asset in {\"XAU\", \"WTIOIL\", \"GOOGLX\", \"TSLAX\"}:\n                    alpha_k = np.minimum(s2_bar_k / max(s2_fwd_mean, 0.1), 1.0)\n                    diff_k = log_ewma - log_ewma[5]\n                    log_ewma = np.where(diff_k < 0.0, log_ewma[5] + (0.5 + 0.5 * alpha_k) * diff_k, log_ewma)\n            w_long = WEIGHTS_24H_LONG\n            p_w = 0.10\n            sigma_short = float(np.exp(np.dot(WEIGHTS_24H_SHORT, log_ewma)))\n            sigma_long_ctx = float(np.exp(np.dot(w_long, log_ewma)))\n            sigma_long = float(\n                np.exp((1.0 - p_w) * np.log(sigma_long_ctx) + p_w * np.log(lt_sigma))\n            )\n            if asset in CRYPTO_ASSETS and len(vals) >= 1440:\n                idx_24h = int(np.searchsorted(valid_pos, max(0, len(vals) - 1440)))\n                rv_24h = float(np.sqrt(np.sum(rets[idx_24h:] ** 2)))\n                er_24h = abs(float(np.log(vals[valid_pos[-1]] / vals[valid_pos[idx_24h]]))) / max(rv_24h, 1e-6)\n                if er_24h < 0.35:\n                    brk_mult = 1.0 - 0.06 * (0.35 - er_24h)\n                elif er_24h > 0.55 and sigma_short > sigma_long:\n                    brk_mult = 1.0 + 0.05 * min(er_24h - 0.55, 0.45)\n    else:\n        sigma_short = lt_sigma\n        sigma_long = lt_sigma\n\n    c_scale, sig_path_vv, sig_step_vv = _distribution_params(asset, time_length)\n\n    mid_lead_mins = (np.arange(n_inc, dtype=np.float64) + 0.5) * step_mins\n    rev_tau = REVERSION_TAU_1H if is_1h else REVERSION_TAU_24H\n    decay = np.exp(-mid_lead_mins / rev_tau)\n    sigma_base_t = sigma_long * ((sigma_short / max(sigma_long, 1e-8)) ** decay)\n\n    per_step_sigma = (c_scale * brk_mult * sigma_base_t) * step_seas_sqrt\n\n    half = num_simulations // 2\n    if half > 0:\n        eps = rng.standard_normal((half, n_inc))\n        if sig_step_vv > 0.0:\n            eta = rng.standard_normal((half, n_inc))\n            eps = eps * np.exp(sig_step_vv * eta - 0.5 * sig_step_vv * sig_step_vv)\n        if sig_path_vv > 0.0:\n            q_z = _stratified_normal_quantiles(half)\n            m_half = np.exp(sig_path_vv * q_z - 0.5 * sig_path_vv * sig_path_vv)[:, None]\n            eps = eps * m_half\n        if num_simulations % 2 == 1:\n            z_extra = rng.standard_normal((1, n_inc))\n            z = np.vstack([eps, -eps, z_extra])\n        else:\n            z = np.vstack([eps, -eps])\n        col_std = np.std(z, axis=0, keepdims=True)\n        z = z / np.where(col_std > 1e-8, col_std, 1.0)\n    else:\n        z = rng.standard_normal((num_simulations, n_inc))\n\n    shocks_inc = z * per_step_sigma[None, :]\n    if is_1h:\n        if asset != \"ETH\":\n            shocks_inc = _apply_secant_shocks(shocks_inc, eta_tot=1.0, eta_blk=0.95, n_blks=4)\n    elif asset not in CRYPTO_ASSETS:\n        eta_equ = 1.05 if asset == \"SPCX\" else 1.09\n        shocks_inc = _apply_secant_shocks(shocks_inc, eta_tot=eta_equ, eta_blk=1.0, n_blks=8)\n\n    shocks = np.empty((num_simulations, steps), dtype=np.float64)\n    shocks[:, 0] = 0.0\n    shocks[:, 1:] = shocks_inc\n    paths = last * np.exp(np.cumsum(shocks, axis=1))\n    return (start_time, time_increment, *[p.tolist() for p in paths])"}}
